/ Le relief du domaine en 3D et la simulation du ruissellement. Comme la carte,
  la page n'a pas d'en-tête : tout l'écran est la scène, les réglages flottent
  dans un panneau repliable.

- choice_css = "flex-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-xs text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50 aria-pressed:bg-forest aria-pressed:font-semibold aria-pressed:text-white"
- group_css = "flex gap-0.5 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-white p-0.5"
- label_css = "mb-1 text-xs font-medium text-stone-500"
- section_title_css = "mb-2 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-stone-400"

- unless @terrain.installed?
  .m-8.rounded-2xl.border.border-dashed.p-8.text-center class="border-amber-300 bg-amber-50/40"
    p.font-averia.text-xl.text-stone-800 Le relief n'est pas encore installé.
    p.mt-2.text-sm.text-stone-500
      | Le modèle de terrain vient du Géoportail de la Wallonie et ne vit pas dans le dépôt : il s'installe avec la tâche
      code.mx-1.rounded.bg-stone-100.px-1.py-0.5.text-xs rake map:terrain:import
      | , qui le télécharge en une minute environ.
    p.mt-4 = link_to "Retour à la carte", map_path, class: "text-sm font-medium text-forest hover:underline"
- else
  div[class="relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#dfe9ee]"
      data-controller="map-relief"
      data-map-relief-grid-url-value=map_relief_grid_path(v: @version)
      data-map-relief-texture-url-value=(@terrain.texture? ? map_relief_texture_path(v: @version) : "")
      data-map-relief-surface-url-value=(@terrain.surface? ? map_relief_surface_path(v: @version) : "")
      data-map-relief-surface-meta-value=(@meta["surface"] || {}).slice("z_min", "z_unit").to_json
      data-map-relief-meta-value=@meta.slice("cols", "rows", "west", "north", "step", "cell_size_m", "z_min", "z_unit", "nodata").to_json
      data-map-relief-features-url-value=map_features_path(format: :json)
      data-map-relief-feature-layers-value=@feature_layers.to_json]
    div.absolute.inset-0 data-map-relief-target="viewport"

    p[class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-1/2 z-10 -translate-y-1/2 text-center text-sm text-stone-600"
      data-map-relief-target="loading"] Chargement du relief…

    / Le panneau des réglages.
    div[class="absolute left-3 top-3 z-20 flex max-h-[calc(100%-1.5rem)] w-72 max-w-[calc(100vw-1.5rem)] flex-col rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white/95 shadow-lg backdrop-blur"
        data-map-relief-target="panel"]
      .flex.items-center.gap-2.px-3.py-2.5
        = link_to map_path, class: "flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-500 hover:bg-stone-100 hover:text-forest", title: "Retour à la carte", aria: { label: "Retour à la carte" } do
          svg.h-4.w-4 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
            path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"
        h1.flex-1.text-sm.font-semibold.text-stone-800 Relief et ruissellement
        button[type="button"
               class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-stone-500 hover:bg-stone-100"
               aria-expanded="true"
               aria-label="Replier les réglages"
               data-action="map-relief#togglePanel"]
          svg.h-4.w-4 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
            path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"

      div.min-h-0.overflow-y-auto.border-t.border-stone-100.px-3.pb-3.pt-3 data-map-relief-target="panelBody"
        p class=section_title_css Vue
        p class=label_css Fond
        div class=group_css data-choice-group="base"
          button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed="true" data-action="map-relief#setBase" data-map-relief-value-param="ortho" Ortho 2026
          button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed="false" data-action="map-relief#setBase" data-map-relief-value-param="altitudes" Altitudes
          - if @terrain.surface?
            button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed="false" data-action="map-relief#setBase" data-map-relief-value-param="canopy" title="Hauteur au-dessus du sol : herbe, arbustes, arbres" Végétation

        .mt-3
          .flex.items-center.justify-between
            label.text-xs.font-medium.text-stone-500 for="relief-exaggeration" Exagération du relief
            span.text-xs.font-semibold.tabular-nums.text-stone-700 data-map-relief-target="exaggerationLabel" ×2,5
          input#relief-exaggeration[type="range" min="1" max="5" step="0.5" value="2.5"
                                    class="mt-1 w-full accent-forest"
                                    data-map-relief-target="exaggeration"
                                    data-action="input->map-relief#setExaggeration"]

        .mt-3
          p class=label_css Courbes de niveau
          div class=group_css data-choice-group="contour"
            - [[0, "Aucune"], [1, "1 m"], [2.5, "2,5 m"], [5, "5 m"]].each do |value, label|
              button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed=(value == 5).to_s data-action="map-relief#setContour" data-map-relief-value-param=value = label
          p.mt-1.text-xs.text-stone-400 Une courbe sur cinq est plus marquée.

        .mt-3.space-y-1.5
          - [["axes", "Axes d'écoulement", "Là où l'eau se rassemble : du bleu clair (0,2 ha drainé) au bleu profond (tout le vallon)."],
             ["hollows", "Cuvettes", "Les creux où l'eau stagne avant de déborder."],
             ["features", "Objets de la carte", "Lieux, gestion, accueil et réseaux."],
             ["particles", "Traceurs du courant", "Pendant la pluie, des points suivent l'eau."]].each do |key, label, hint|
            label.flex.cursor-pointer.items-start.gap-2.text-sm.text-stone-700
              input[type="checkbox" checked=true
                    class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-stone-300 text-forest focus:ring-teal-400"
                    data-action="change->map-relief#toggle"
                    data-map-relief-key-param=key]
              span
                span.block = label
                span.block.text-xs.text-stone-400 = hint

        - if @terrain.surface?
          label class="mt-1.5 flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-2 text-sm text-stone-700"
            input[type="checkbox"
                  class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-stone-300 text-forest focus:ring-teal-400"
                  data-map-relief-target="surfaceToggle"
                  data-action="change->map-relief#toggleSurface"]
            span
              span.block Arbres et toits en relief
              span.block.text-xs.text-stone-400 La canopée du LiDAR en volume, à sa vraie hauteur même sur un relief exagéré.

        button[type="button"
               class="mt-3 text-xs font-medium text-forest hover:underline"
               data-action="map-relief#resetView"] Recentrer la vue

        / Le soleil : l'ombre à une heure donnée, ou les heures de soleil direct
          d'une journée, calculées sur les arbres et les toits.
        .mt-4.border-t.border-stone-100.pt-3 data-map-relief-target="sunSection"
          p class=section_title_css Soleil
          div class=group_css data-choice-group="sunMode"
            - [["off", "Éteint"], ["instant", "Ombres"], ["hours", "Heures de soleil"]].each do |value, label|
              button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed=(value == "off").to_s data-action="map-relief#setSunMode" data-map-relief-value-param=value = label
          p class="#{label_css} mt-2" Jour
          div class=group_css data-choice-group="sunDate"
            - [["12-21", "21 déc."], ["03-20", "20 mars"], ["06-21", "21 juin"], ["today", "Aujourd'hui"]].each do |value, label|
              button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed=(value == "06-21").to_s data-action="map-relief#setSunDate" data-map-relief-value-param=value = label
          .mt-2.hidden data-map-relief-target="sunHourRow"
            .flex.items-center.justify-between
              label.text-xs.font-medium.text-stone-500 for="relief-sun-hour" Heure
              span.text-xs.font-semibold.tabular-nums.text-stone-700 data-map-relief-target="sunHourLabel" 14 h 00
            input#relief-sun-hour[type="range" min="300" max="1320" step="5" value="840"
                                  class="mt-1 w-full accent-forest"
                                  data-map-relief-target="sunHour"
                                  data-action="input->map-relief#setSunHour"]
          button[type="button"
                 class="mt-2 flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-50"
                 data-map-relief-target="dayButton"
                 data-action="map-relief#toggleDay"]
            svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
              circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"
              path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"
            span data-map-relief-target="dayLabel" Faire passer la journée
          .mt-2.hidden data-map-relief-target="sunLegend"
            div class="h-2 rounded-full" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(30,27,75), rgb(109,40,217), rgb(245,158,11), rgb(253,224,71))"
            .mt-1.flex.justify-between.text-xs.text-stone-500
              span 0 h
              span data-map-relief-target="sunLegendMax"
            p.mt-1.text-xs.text-stone-400 En forêt, la valeur est celle du sommet des arbres ; le relief au-delà de 150 m autour du domaine n'est pas compté.
          p.mt-2.text-xs.text-stone-500 data-map-relief-target="sunStatus" aria-live="polite"
          - unless @terrain.surface?
            p.mt-1.text-xs.text-amber-700 Sans le modèle de surface, seules les ombres du relief comptent : arbres et toits n'en portent pas.

        .mt-4.border-t.border-stone-100.pt-3
          p class=section_title_css Pluie
          p class=label_css Intensité
          div class=group_css data-choice-group="intensity"
            - [[10, "Pluie"], [30, "Forte"], [60, "Orage"]].each do |value, label|
              button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed=(value == 30).to_s data-action="map-relief#setRain" data-map-relief-key-param="intensity" data-map-relief-value-param=value
                = label
                span class="block text-[0.65rem] opacity-70" = "#{value} mm/h"
          p class="#{label_css} mt-2" Durée de l'averse
          div class=group_css data-choice-group="duration"
            - [[15, "15 min"], [30, "30 min"], [60, "1 h"], [120, "2 h"]].each do |value, label|
              button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed=(value == 60).to_s data-action="map-relief#setRain" data-map-relief-key-param="duration" data-map-relief-value-param=value = label
          p class="#{label_css} mt-2" Le sol boit
          div class=group_css data-choice-group="infiltration"
            - [[2, "Tassé"], [10, "Prairie"], [40, "Forêt"]].each do |value, label|
              button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed=(value == 10).to_s data-action="map-relief#setRain" data-map-relief-key-param="infiltration" data-map-relief-value-param=value
                = label
                span class="block text-[0.65rem] opacity-70" = "#{value} mm/h"
          p class="#{label_css} mt-2" Vitesse
          div class=group_css data-choice-group="speed"
            - [[1, "Lente"], [4, "Normale"], [16, "Rapide"]].each do |value, label|
              button type="button" class=choice_css aria-pressed=(value == 4).to_s data-action="map-relief#setRain" data-map-relief-key-param="speed" data-map-relief-value-param=value = label

          .mt-3.flex.gap-2
            button[type="button"
                   class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-forest px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-90"
                   aria-pressed="false"
                   data-map-relief-target="playButton"
                   data-action="map-relief#togglePlay"]
              svg.h-4.w-4 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
                path d="M20 16.2A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 17.5 8h-1.8A7 7 0 1 0 4 14.9"
                path d="M16 14v6M8 14v6M12 16v6"
              span data-map-relief-target="playLabel" Faire pleuvoir
            button[type="button"
                   class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50"
                   data-action="map-relief#resetRain"] Réinitialiser

          .mt-3.rounded-lg.bg-stone-50.p-2.text-xs
            .flex.items-baseline.justify-between
              span.text-stone-500 Temps simulé
              span.font-semibold.tabular-nums.text-stone-800 data-map-relief-target="clock" 0 min 00
            p.mt-0.5.text-stone-500 data-map-relief-target="rainState" 30 mm/h pendant 1 h
            dl.mt-2.space-y-0.5 data-map-relief-target="stats"

        p class="mt-4 text-[0.7rem] leading-snug text-stone-400"
          | Terrain nu (MNT) et surface (MNS) LiDAR 2021-2022 du SPW, 1 m, sur le domaine et 150 m autour. L'eau coule sur le terrain nu, les ombres tombent des arbres et des toits. La pluie est une illustration : un sol uniforme, sans fossés busés.
          - if @meta["fetched_at"].present?
            = " Relief téléchargé le #{l(Time.zone.parse(@meta['fetched_at']).to_date, format: :long)}."

    div[class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 z-20 hidden max-w-xs space-y-0.5 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white/95 p-3 text-xs text-stone-600 shadow-lg backdrop-blur"
        data-map-relief-target="probe"
        aria-live="polite"]

    p[class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-3 left-1/2 z-10 hidden -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-white/80 px-3 py-1 text-[0.7rem] text-stone-500 md:block"]
      | Glisser pour tourner · clic droit pour déplacer · molette pour zoomer · un clic sonde le terrain
